WEBVTT

00:00:28.996 --> 00:00:31.716
The noise you hear
was from the kindergarten nearby,

00:00:31.756 --> 00:00:33.436
not from the machine noise.

00:00:33.476 --> 00:00:34.996
The machines were electric,

00:00:35.036 --> 00:00:39.916
and so were the trucks that transport
materials to and from the site.

00:00:39.956 --> 00:00:42.916
As head of the climate agency in Oslo,

00:00:42.956 --> 00:00:46.996
the Klosterenga construction
site is a climate measure

00:00:47.036 --> 00:00:49.476
I'm really excited about.

00:00:50.076 --> 00:00:53.196
The workers here are opening a stream

00:00:53.236 --> 00:00:57.996
that has been confined in pipelines
for more than 120 years.

00:00:58.676 --> 00:01:02.396
And as climate changes in Oslo,